sequenceDiagram
    participant LMS as LMS (Tenant Client)
    participant API as AmmaWallet API
    participant BilSvc as billing.service.ts
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Neon)
    participant Stellar as Stellar Network

    LMS->>API: POST /api/v1/wallets<br/>x-api-key: amma_XXXX

    Note over API: requireTenantApiKey middleware
    API->>DB: SELECT tenant_api_keys<br/>WHERE key_hash = SHA256(key)
    DB-->>API: {tenantId, scopes, rateLimit}

    Note over API: Rate limit check (in-memory)

    API->>BilSvc: checkWalletBilling(tenantId, userId)
    BilSvc->>DB: getBillingPolicy(tenantId)
    DB-->>BilSvc: BillingPolicy
    BilSvc->>DB: getTenantBillingState(tenantId)
    DB-->>BilSvc: {balance, isActive, suspendedAt}

    alt Tenant suspended or inactive
        BilSvc-->>API: {ok: false, httpStatus: 402/403}
        API-->>LMS: 402/403 Error
    end

    BilSvc->>DB: countUserWallets(userId)
    DB-->>BilSvc: walletCount

    alt walletCount == 0 (new activation)
        Note over BilSvc: amount = walletFunding + platformFee<br/>(3 XLM default)
        alt Acquisition mode & balance > debtLimit
            BilSvc-->>API: {ok: true, eventType: new_wallet_activation, amount: -3.0}
        else balance <= debtLimit
            BilSvc-->>API: {ok: false, httpStatus: 402}
            API-->>LMS: 402 Debt limit reached
        end
    else walletCount > 0 (onboarding)
        Note over BilSvc: amount = onboardingFee (1 XLM default)
        alt balance > 0
            BilSvc-->>API: {ok: true, eventType: existing_user_onboarding, amount: -1.0}
        else balance <= 0
            BilSvc-->>API: {ok: false, httpStatus: 402}
            API-->>LMS: 402 Insufficient balance
        end
    end

    Note over API: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>DB: SELECT tenants FOR UPDATE<br/>(TOCTOU guard)
    API->>BilSvc: checkWalletBillingTx(tx, tenantId, userId)
    Note over BilSvc: Re-validate with lock held

    API->>BilSvc: writeBillingDebit(tx, ...)
    BilSvc->>DB: INSERT billing_events
    BilSvc->>DB: UPDATE tenants SET balance = balance + amount
    DB-->>BilSvc: {billingEventId, newBalance}

    API->>Stellar: Create + fund wallet
    Stellar-->>API: txHash

    API->>DB: INSERT funding_events
    API->>BilSvc: upsertTenantUser(tx, tenantId, userId)
    BilSvc->>DB: INSERT tenant_users ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING

    Note over API: COMMIT TRANSACTION

    API-->>LMS: 200 {publicKey, funded: true}

    Note over BilSvc: After commit (fire-and-forget)
    BilSvc->>DB: maybeNotifyDeficit() if balance < 0
